{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three heroines, wielding powerful cards and a fierce will to survive, must face an ancient evil cult in a perilous dungeon crawl, where every battle is a desperate fight for survival and every creature collected could be the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978310/extras/CombatGif.gif?t=1741341442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this adventure you play as one of three heroines. Where you must battle, survive, and collect creatures to aid you in battles. All to get back your mortal souls from an evil sorceress known only as <strong>&quot;Creator&quot;</strong>. She the leader of a radical cult known as <strong>&quot;The Out Raiders&quot;</strong> who view the world as nothing, but a play object to manipulate. Do you have what it takes bring her evil to an end. In this <strong>Deck Building</strong>, <strong>Roguelike Dungeon Crawler</strong>, and <strong>Creature Collecting Adventure</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978310/extras/videoCards-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1741341442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Features:</strong></i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Combat &amp; Deck Building &amp; Creature Collecting Action\u00a0 &amp; Top Down Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take manual Control &amp; Explore Dungeons &amp; Dash Towards Foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy Cards, Potions, and more to survive </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Run is unique no too battles are the same </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a colourful cast of friends and foes along the way </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original Art brimming with personality </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragra